+        #    tensormap_create, ~2.5x slower than a pointer load); leave hoistable
+        #    / out-of-loop descriptors on the fast TMA path. No-ops if none match.
+        #  * TRITON_INTEL_NVIDIA_DISABLE_LOOP_TD_REWRITE: skip entirely, keep the
